WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.840
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No placing pranks in

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.759
new staff's desks and liquefying them in "record
time!"

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:11.619
Starting a new job can be a stressful experience.

00:00:11.619 --> 00:00:15.570
Figuring out the office culture, choosing
a coffee cup in the break room, and deciding

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.339
which funko pops look best on your desk, it's
a lot to think about!

00:00:19.339 --> 00:00:23.220
The last thing a new employee needs is to
sit down at their brand new desk, open a drawer

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.570
to grab a pen, and have their flesh melted
from their skull by a bright blast of mysterious

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:28.690
green light.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:33.590
It's not funny, we're not impressed anymore,
and staff turnover at the Foundation is already

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.540
high enough as it is.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:40.550
No more pranks, it's not a "right of passage"
if they don't survive it, Dr. Bright!!!

